適，音樂也chill，叉燒飯非常好吃、啤酒很有特色、鮭魚肚切得非常好看，厚切吃起來就是爽，cp值很高。\n跟老闆聊了一下原來年紀差不多、讀過一樣學校、又一樣住過木柵和中和，真的很巧",null,[0,186]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/699415876248596367/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZMYVdRMVgwZEpiemsyVEdaUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,5713,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLaWQ1X0dJbzk2TGZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x8d3be00e65acf860!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEKid5_GIo96LfQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLaWQ1X0dJbzk2TGZREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLaWQ1X0dJbzk2TGZREi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRU5XcF9lREdoN2psYWcSE0Nnd0lvb1RDd1FZUXFPMnY1Z0UaLQoWQ0lITTBvZ0tFTDJLcDZEcnlMempiURITQ2d3SW9vVEN3UVlRcU8ydjVnRSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEWD4rGUO4DuNKgswY0JMVzZqZnlQYw\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjD7fzmxNKWAxVxdPUHHfvSJyUQoykI6wEoCw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjO6YLnxNKWAxVseF4EHQunE2MQ0pMFCI8BKAU"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjD7fzmxNKWAxVxdPUHHfvSJyUQ0pMFCNgBKAU"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pjNVZtVk5jV1ZsZURkcGJqazRjMEZWWkdWUGRuYxAB",["0x0:0x8d3be00e65acf860",null,1750630213278251,1750630213278251,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112970120318536841779/reviews?hl\u003d